{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_fdf80dc8-dac3-4db8-9edf-3984dfd6b5b1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_01a163d89d2974239f977a4538dcee49","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/agent/journal.md","old_string":"- **Plan**: EDA on snapshot → baseline starter CRPS → v1: EWMA vol level + per-asset seasonal\n  vol profile (fitted offline, embedded) + AR(1) log-vol + Student-t shocks, zero drift,\n  simulated at the scoring step. Kill thresholds set per experiment below.","new_string":"- **Plan**: EDA on snapshot → baseline starter CRPS → v1: EWMA vol level + per-asset seasonal\n  vol profile (fitted offline, embedded) + AR(1) log-vol + Student-t shocks, zero drift,\n  simulated at the scoring step. Kill thresholds set per experiment below.\n\n## Iteration 1 — EDA + v1 (seasonal SV Student-t fan)\n- **Hypothesis**: (a) vol seasonality is large (measured: equities/gold hour-of-day range\n  0.3–3.4x, weekend 0.2–0.6x of weekday; crypto flatter 0.5–2.1x, weekend 0.55–0.8x),\n  (b) 1-min standardized tails ≈ Student-t df 4–6 at 0.1% quantile, (c) vol clusters\n  (RV5m/RV1h variance ratio ≈ 0.75 → stochastic vol matters beyond per-step tails).\n- **Change**: `modeling.py` v1 — deseasonalised returns via per-asset (weekday×hour) profile\n  fitted offline (`artifacts.json`); level = 0.7·fast(6h HL)+0.3·slow(3d HL) EWMA variance;\n  forward AR(1) log-vol (6h half-life, stationary sd 0.45 in log-sigma), t(6) shocks,\n  re-seasonalised, simulated at 1-min, sub-sampled to the scoring step. Env-switchable\n  NU/VOLSD/FASTW/SEAS/SV for ablation. Seed: `SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED` + asset|start_time CRC.\n- **Result** (3d to 2026-09-30, 1000 paths, official backtester; starter → v1):\n  BTC 24h 2329.4 → **2185.9** (−6.2%); XAU 24h 1383.0 → **1147.6** (−17.0%);\n  BTC 1h (--latest-formula) 539.1 → **509.6** (−5.5%).\n- **Verdict**: keep v1 as new base. **Lesson**: seasonality is the big lever for COM_EQU;\n  ablate before tuning further."}}],"model":"meta/muse-wonder-1.0","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c4d1346-5ef5-4ae8-af7f-555535414d85","uuid":"117190be-6c8e-4024-81dd-66b8106b142b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:41:46.268Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01a163d89d2974239f977a4538dcee49","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/agent/journal.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c4d1346-5ef5-4ae8-af7f-555535414d85","uuid":"862e914e-79ee-49ea-b058-ca28b2713adb","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:41:46.286Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/agent/journal.md","oldString":"- **Plan**: EDA on snapshot → baseline starter CRPS → v1: EWMA vol level + per-asset seasonal\n  vol profile (fitted offline, embedded) + AR(1) log-vol + Student-t shocks, zero drift,\n  simulated at the scoring step. Kill thresholds set per experiment below.","newString":"- **Plan**: EDA on snapshot → baseline starter CRPS → v1: EWMA vol level + per-asset seasonal\n  vol profile (fitted offline, embedded) + AR(1) log-vol + Student-t shocks, zero drift,\n  simulated at the scoring step. Kill thresholds set per experiment below.\n\n## Iteration 1 — EDA + v1 (seasonal SV Student-t fan)\n- **Hypothesis**: (a) vol seasonality is large (measured: equities/gold hour-of-day range\n  0.3–3.4x, weekend 0.2–0.6x of weekday; crypto flatter 0.5–2.1x, weekend 0.55–0.8x),\n  (b) 1-min standardized tails ≈ Student-t df 4–6 at 0.1% quantile, (c) vol clusters\n  (RV5m/RV1h variance ratio ≈ 0.75 → stochastic vol matters beyond per-step tails).\n- **Change**: `modeling.py` v1 — deseasonalised returns via per-asset (weekday×hour) profile\n  fitted offline (`artifacts.json`); level = 0.7·fast(6h HL)+0.3·slow(3d HL) EWMA variance;\n  forward AR(1) log-vol (6h half-life, stationary sd 0.45 in log-sigma), t(6) shocks,\n  re-seasonalised, simulated at 1-min, sub-sampled to the scoring step. Env-switchable\n  NU/VOLSD/FASTW/SEAS/SV for ablation. Seed: `SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED` + asset|start_time CRC.\n- **Result** (3d to 2026-09-30, 1000 paths, official backtester; starter → v1):\n  BTC 24h 2329.4 → **2185.9** (−6.2%); XAU 24h 1383.0 → **1147.6** (−17.0%);\n  BTC 1h (--latest-formula) 539.1 → **509.6** (−5.5%).\n- **Verdict**: keep v1 as new base. **Lesson**: seasonality is the big lever for COM_EQU;\n  ablate before tuning further.","originalFile":"# Journal — campaign-6\n\n## Iteration 0 — setup & scoring anatomy (pre-registered)\n- **Hypothesis**: Reading `synth.validator.crps_calculation`: 24h score = sum of CRPS over\n  return-changes at 5min (288 pts), 30min (48), 3h (8) + terminal absolute price (1, scaled).\n  1h score = return CRPS at 1/2/5/15/30min + terminal + 12 \"gap-from-start\" returns + vol-CRPS\n  (lambda=5.25 over 60/15/5min block realized-vol). So short-horizon marginals dominate counts,\n  and (for 1h) the *dispersion of block realized vol* is scored directly.\n- **Implication**: constant-vol Gaussian (starter) will be wrong on (a) time-of-day/week vol\n  seasonality, (b) vol clustering → block-RV dispersion & multi-horizon fat tails, (c) per-step\n  fat tails. Judge everything on CRPS via `agent/predict.py`, per config/asset.\n- **Plan**: EDA on snapshot → baseline starter CRPS → v1: EWMA vol level + per-asset seasonal\n  vol profile (fitted offline, embedded) + AR(1) log-vol + Student-t shocks, zero drift,\n  simulated at the scoring step. Kill thresholds set per experiment below.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":12,"oldLines":3,"newStart":12,"newLines":19,"lines":[" - **Plan**: EDA on snapshot → baseline starter CRPS → v1: EWMA vol level + per-asset seasonal","   vol profile (fitted offline, embedded) + AR(1) log-vol + Student-t shocks, zero drift,","   simulated at the scoring step. Kill thresholds set per experiment below.","+","+## Iteration 1 — EDA + v1 (seasonal SV Student-t fan)","+- **Hypothesis**: (a) vol seasonality is large (measured: equities/gold hour-of-day range","+  0.3–3.4x, weekend 0.2–0.6x of weekday; crypto flatter 0.5–2.1x, weekend 0.55–0.8x),","+  (b) 1-min standardized tails ≈ Student-t df 4–6 at 0.1% quantile, (c) vol clusters","+  (RV5m/RV1h variance ratio ≈ 0.75 → stochastic vol matters beyond per-step tails).","+- **Change**: `modeling.py` v1 — deseasonalised returns via per-asset (weekday×hour) profile","+  fitted offline (`artifacts.json`); level = 0.7·fast(6h HL)+0.3·slow(3d HL) EWMA variance;","+  forward AR(1) log-vol (6h half-life, stationary sd 0.45 in log-sigma), t(6) shocks,","+  re-seasonalised, simulated at 1-min, sub-sampled to the scoring step. Env-switchable","+  NU/VOLSD/FASTW/SEAS/SV for ablation. Seed: `SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED` + asset|start_time CRC.","+- **Result** (3d to 2026-09-30, 1000 paths, official backtester; starter → v1):","+  BTC 24h 2329.4 → **2185.9** (−6.2%); XAU 24h 1383.0 → **1147.6** (−17.0%);","+  BTC 1h (--latest-formula) 539.1 → **509.6** (−5.5%).","+- **Verdict**: keep v1 as new base. **Lesson**: seasonality is the big lever for COM_EQU;","+  ablate before tuning further."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
