{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_a80343b0-a856-45b4-b503-150c4c7593e3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Campaign complete. Champion nominated and verified; all deliverables committed.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Champion** (`agent/CHAMPION` → commit `8050e9f`, harness interface check: **ok, 24h + 1h**): a single seasonal stochastic-volatility Student-t fan in `agent/modeling.py` serving all three configurations — 1-minute simulation sub-sampled to the scoring step, per-asset (weekday×hour) vol profiles (NY-anchored for the 8 COM_EQU perps), fast/slow EWMA vol level with 48h vol mean-reversion, ν=5 shocks, zero drift, horizon-split width (×0.90 24h / ×0.95 1h), and calendar-driven event vol multipliers. ~0.2 s per 1000-path prompt; degenerate contexts unit-tested.\n\n**Measured results** (official `synth-lib` backtester, 1000 paths, two disjoint 3-day windows):\n\n| Config | Sep window | Oct window |\n|---|---|---|\n| CRYPTO_24H | 3829 | 3648 |\n| COM_EQU_24H | 1519 | 1837 |\n| CRYPTO_1H | 894 | 726 |\n\nvs the starter on identical prompts: BTC 24h −7.5%, XAU −16.2%, BTC 1h −5.6%.\n\n**What mattered** (all judged on CRPS, two-window, per-cell sign counts): vol seasonality (−6…−17%, the dominant lever), slow vol persistence (−0.27%), NY-anchored profiles (−0.3%), honest global width (−0.3%, confirmed out-of-window in July). **What didn't**: drift, jumps, bootstrap shocks, 168-bucket profiles, the 1h vol-CRPS term (≈1% of the score despite λ=5.25), gap-return corrections — each tested and rejected on measurement, documented in `journal.md` (9 iterations) and `report.md`.\n\nStopped with $7/100 and ~14 h unused deliberately: every remaining lever's expected gain sits below the ±0.15% noise floor of the only two official validation windows, so further spend couldn't certify an improvement."}],"model":"meta/muse-wonder-1.0","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c4d1346-5ef5-4ae8-af7f-555535414d85","uuid":"a7b3b4f3-4222-4f58-b4e8-705cb4e10585","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:16:08.459Z"}
